# GitCommit AI — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env. A .env in the current directory, or else in the root of
# the Git repository, is loaded automatically. Parent directories and your home
# directory are never searched. It is read into memory only; it is never
# exported into your shell. Precedence, highest first:
#   command-line flags > real environment variables > .env > defaults
# Run `git-ai-commit config` to see which value is in effect and where it came from.

# --- Provider selection -------------------------------------------------------
# One of: openai, anthropic, gemini, ollama (default: openai)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_PROVIDER=openai

# Model name. When unset the provider default is used:
#   openai: gpt-4o-mini | anthropic: claude-sonnet-5-5
#   gemini: gemini-2.5-flash | ollama: llama3.1
# GITCOMMIT_AI_MODEL=

# --- API keys -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Only the key for the provider you use is needed. Ollama needs none.
# Keep real keys out of version control: .env is git-ignored in this repository.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# --- Ollama -------------------------------------------------------------------
# GITCOMMIT_AI_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434

# --- Generation tuning --------------------------------------------------------
# Sampling temperature, 0 to 2 (default: 0.3)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_TEMPERATURE=0.3
# Seconds to wait for a single LLM request (default: 60)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_TIMEOUT=60
# Maximum generate/critique rounds before the best draft is used, 1 to 10 (default: 3)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_MAX_ITERATIONS=3
# Characters of diff sent to the model, at least 1000 (default: 24000)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_MAX_DIFF_CHARS=24000

# --- Retries ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rate limits and transient errors (timeouts, dropped connections, 5xx) are retried.
# Retries after the first attempt, 0 to 10; 0 disables retrying (default: 3)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_MAX_RETRIES=3
# Seconds before the first retry; it doubles each time (default: 1)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_RETRY_BASE_DELAY=1
# Longest wait before any retry. A server's retry-after longer than this is not
# waited out. Must be at least the base delay (default: 30)
# GITCOMMIT_AI_RETRY_MAX_DELAY=30

# --- Advanced -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Load this file instead of looking for .env in the current directory and repo root; set it empty to skip .env loading.
# This one only takes effect as a real environment variable, not inside a .env file.
# GITCOMMIT_AI_ENV_FILE=
# Set to 0 (as a real environment variable) to skip the prepare-commit-msg hook
# for one commit:  GITCOMMIT_AI_HOOK=0 git commit
# GITCOMMIT_AI_HOOK=
